<title>GERMANY: Hoechst sup board approves holding plans.</title>
<headline>Hoechst sup board approves holding plans.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals and drugs group Hoechst AG said on Tuesday that its supervisory board had approved plans to transform the entire group into a strategic holding company.</p>
<p>Hoechst announced plans to transform itself into a strategic holding company last fall in a bid to streamline operations and offer more value to shareholders.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
